    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Generalized <span class="search-hit mathjax">Veto</span> Core and a Practical Voting Rule with Optimal <span class="search-hit mathjax">Metric</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Distortion</span>
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
