      <span class="search-hit">Abstract</span>:
      <span class="abstract-short has-text-grey-dark mathjax" id="1911.08129v2-abstract-short" style="display: inline;">
        In <span class="search-hit mathjax">distortion</span>-based analysis of social choice rules over&hellip;
        <a class="is-size-7" style="white-space: nowrap;" onclick="document.getElementById('1911.08129v2-abstract-full').style.display = 'inline'; document.getElementById('1911.08129v2-abstract-short').style.display = 'none';">&#9661; More</a>
